# DSDT pipeline inputs/outputs (regenerated from YOUR machine's firmware dump —
# dsdt/original & dsdt/work may contain the MSDM table = a Windows product key: never commit.
# `acpidump -b` emits MSDM alongside DSDT/SSDTs, so also ignore any stray MSDM dump, anywhere.
dsdt/original/
dsdt/work/
MSDM
MSDM.*
msdm
msdm.*
dsdt/patched/*.dsl
dsdt/patched/*.aml
dsdt/patched/acpi_override.img
dsdt/reference/honor-fmb-p-dsdt/

# ISO builder outputs
*.iso
